<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-C MARCH NET UP TO PLN 2.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-C MARCH NET UP TO PLN 2.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.16 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.57 vs   0.54</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.49 vs   1.50</p>
<p> Sales		   24.92 vs  19.11</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.60 vs   1.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.22 vs   2.74</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.83 vs   3.83</p>
<p> Sales		   73.54 vs  59.13</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Cieszyn</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
